 mastitis: diagnostic and therapeutic considerations</article-title><source>World J Surg</source><year>2003</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>515</fpage><lpage>518</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12715214</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00268-003-6806-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lai</surname><given-names>EC</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name><name><surname>Ma</surname><given-names>TK</given-names></name><name><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Poon</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Leong</surname><given-names>HT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The role of conservative treatment in idiopathic granulomatous mastitis</article-title><source>Breast J</source><year>2005</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>454</fpage><lpage>456</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16297091</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1075-122X.2005.00127.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fletcher</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Magrath</surname><given-names>IM</given-names></name><name><surname>Riddell</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name><name><surname>Talbot</surname><given-names>IC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Granulomatous mastitis: a report of seven cases</article-title><source>J Clin Pathol</source><year>1982</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>941</fpage><lpage>945</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6889612</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/jcp.35.9.941</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Erhan</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Veral</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><n